RollOS — "The 7:40 on a Tuesday"
60 s Whiteboard Explainer, made entirely in code: no video generation, no stock footage.

Built with the Lemo-Opuscar style library (github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar, MIT).
engine/wb.js is that library's whiteboard engine, copied into this project unmodified.
tools/asr_check.py, tools/cuecheck.py, tools/subs.mjs and tools/mux-ffmpeg6.sh are
copies of its tools; local changes are marked in each file.

